{"4120450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dzyun Battle 2026", "steam_appid": 4120450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the holiday showdown in <strong>Dzyun Battle 2026</strong>, a fast-paced, strafe-jump New Year PvP! Fight up to <strong>16v16</strong> with friends and foes across snowy arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite look to terrify your enemies… or make them burst out laughing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120450/extras/c79b34e3dff7e7d270125c08156e4ed5.poster.avif?t=1767774324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120450/extras/c79b34e3dff7e7d270125c08156e4ed5.webm?t=1767774324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120450/extras/c79b34e3dff7e7d270125c08156e4ed5.mp4?t=1767774324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across winter-themed arenas, packed with <strong>teleports, jumppads, and powerups</strong> to gain the upper hand. Fight from <strong>Dawn to Dusk</strong> with a weather system that changes the look and feel of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120450/extras/181d56ed0fd8ad471d8fff4f83a5b35c.poster.avif?t=1767774324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120450/extras/181d56ed0fd8ad471d8fff4f83a5b35c.webm?t=1767774324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>strafe jumps</